        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003206",
        "transcript": "The train arrives at seven-forty-five, and passengers need to board the connector bus before eight.",
        "target_signal": "在“时间”任务中识别并解释关键知识或解题线索",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003207",
        "transcript": "The coach leaves at nine o'clock, but please meet outside the library at eight thirty. We need time to check attendance and load the equipment before departure.",
        "target_signal": "区分集合时间与出发时间",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003208",
        "transcript": "The assignment was due on Tuesday. Because the online system was unavailable yesterday, the deadline has been extended to Thursday. Feedback will still be returned the following Monday.",
